# 📝 TO-DO-APP

A full-stack To-Do application that allows users to securely register, log in, and manage their daily tasks.

## 🚀 Features

- User registration
- User login and authentication
- Secure authentication using JWT
- Create new tasks
- View tasks
- Update tasks
- Delete tasks
- User-specific task management
- RESTful API
- Responsive React frontend
- Node.js and Express.js backend
- MongoDB database integration

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

### Frontend
- React.js
- Vite
- JavaScript
- CSS

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- Mongoose
- JSON Web Token (JWT)

